+# righttenantry-demo-polish-1 field notes
+
+(badge-out: append ≤3 one-liners here)
+
+Start of job:
+- Read the demo-mode shard (righttenantry-demo-mode.md) — the demo dispatches
+  at message level in client.gleam; demo_api mirrors api signatures but the
+  real modules stay byte-identical; every demo_api mutation returns
+  #(store, eff) and MUST be threaded or `let _ = next` silently drops it.
+- Toast component is SHARED (components/toast.gleam, fixed top-20 right-4),
+  not demo-specific — fix 1 must verify before assuming divergence.
+- Compare-top-3 lives in the shared leaderboard_view + falls through to the
+  real UserClickedCompareTop3 handler (demo_update intercepts the /compare
+  fetch) — fix 3 must verify before assuming it is absent.
+- Report PDFs are pre-baked through the REAL audit_report Typst pipeline; the
+  demo passes thin data (income_sources/docs empty), not a thin template.
+- a-grace -> a-grainne purge touches demo_store, demo_fixtures, pdf_prebake +
+  the committed PDF; report download round-trip is pinned (count 8 stays).
+
+Badge-out:
+- demo_store awaiting was STATIC (awaiting(_) ignored store) — moved onto a
+  Dict(vacancy_id -> List(AwaitingApplicant)) field on DemoStore, seeded at
+  seed(); send_reminder/remind_applicant now mutate it and demo_update threads
+  #(next, eff) (was `let _ = next`).
+- fix 4 = enrich pdf_prebake ReportPayload data, NOT the typst template — gave
+  every applicant income_sources + documents + a verification_summary extras
+  blob (drives "At a glance DOCUMENTS PROCESSED" + Verification Methodology);
+  re-bake via RT_DEMO_PRIV_DIR=priv gleam run -m demo/pdf_prebake.
+- fix 1 (toast) + fix 3 (compare top 3) turned out ALREADY at parity by shared
+  component (toast) / shared leaderboard + demo-branched /compare fetch — do
+  NOT invent a cosmetic divergence (would break #615 non-overlap guarantee);
+  pin with tests, let p2B8 re-verify in-browser.
